Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟这东西完全是初次见面耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪里不懂?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.89,0:00:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,首先  你懂这段的意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"打电话给莉依"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,比我想像的更严重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"tell a lie"是"说谎"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那"the last man"呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"最后的男人"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以直译就是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"他是最后一个说谎的人"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是即使世界上的人全都会说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他也会是最后一个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.09,0:00:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说只要翻成他是个诚实的人就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是在说龙斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:01:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就算世界上所有男人都会劈腿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我想龙斗也会是最后一个劈腿的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,白河同学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.53,0:01:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们看下一题吧
Comment: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,咦? 总觉得我好奇怪
Comment: 0,0:01:40.73,0:01:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没有过 这样的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感受到你的温柔 为什么呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸口就会感到难受
Comment: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,相互交叠
Comment: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐混合
Comment: 0,0:01:53.74,0:01:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无论如何都无法停止了(无法!)
Comment: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,被烟火的光线给照亮的
Comment: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你的侧脸
Comment: 0,0:02:04.67,0:02:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,人家正盯着你呢
Comment: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌暧昧 待在我身边
Comment: 0,0:02:13.93,0:02:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,(一直一直 待在我身边)
Comment: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是恋爱吧
Comment: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我了解这感觉的
Comment: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,(这是你带给我的感觉)
Comment: 0,0:02:28.36,0:02:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对象是我真的可以吗?
Comment: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(对象是我真的可以吗?)
Comment: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知所措又无法更进一步 真是的…
Comment: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,忐忑不安又闪闪发光的现在
Comment: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐染上可爱色彩的世界
Comment: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
